rhodey 4-op FM Rhodey piano based on algorithm 5 (STK rhodey) \; instruments inst_sampler monosample loopplayer (with on the fly rec feature) \; instruments inst_scratcher turntable-inspired scratcher \; instruments inst_soundfile basic file reader \; instruments inst_tabosc harmonic / table oscillator (with on the fly rec feature) \; instruments inst_turntable DEPRECATED turntable simulator (with on the fly rec feature) \; midi data_azerty2midi converting azerty/querty keyboard into midi entry keyb \; midi midi_arpeggiator ableton-like midi arpeggiator \; midi midi_notein midi-keyboard interface \; midi note_2param converting note messages into parameter \; midi note_16steps 16 steps modal sequencer \; midi note_interpol midi interpolations (http://poset.labri.fr/interpolations/) \; midi note_randomize midi notein and enveloppe randomizer \; utils audio_in audio input with bus selector \; utils audio_out audio output with bus selector \; utils audio_record for quick-recording \; utils PdRacks.midilearn (obsolete) \; utils PdRacks.midimap midilearn/midi-mapping and midi-interfaces support \; utils PdRacks.midi (obsolete) \; utils PdRacks.morphing enabling morphing netween 2 values \; utils PdRacks.savestate object for saving state of patch and modules \; utils PdRacks.presets simple 8 presets saving module \; utils PdRacks.settings module for PdRacks session \; utils PdRacks.transport clock unit (with abl_link~ external) \; utils container container for dynamically storing a module \;;
